  "name": "Heirloom",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "A dark, cinematic site for a private family office: a crossfading photographic hero, blur-in headlines with an italic serif accent, program cards, a founder testimonial collage, counting stats and a drifting marquee — plus Founders, Membership, Journal, Manifesto and Contact pages with filters, tiers, an FAQ and working forms.",
  "designedFor": [
    "A family office, venture studio or investor network introducing itself with a point of view",
    "Premium membership and community brands that sell on atmosphere and trust",
    "Film-like landing pages where photography and slow, soft motion carry the story",
    "Editors who want named motion components (BlurWords, Slideshow, CountUp, Marquee) to restyle live"
  ],
